  "problem": "The row echelon form matrix $M$ is given below. What are the pivot columns of $M?$\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -3 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
